Inscription Text/Poem: 山の端に　乙鳥をかへす　入日哉
Translation: At the mountain's edge the swallows are sent to bed by the setting sun;
(Translation from Alfred H. Marks, Hiroshige Birds and Flowers, 1988)
Signature: 廣重筆 Hiroshige hitsu (Brushed by Hiroshige)
Seals:  Seals: Designer's seals: 弌立斎 Ichiryūsai; Publisher's seal: 川正 Kawashō (Kawaguchiya Shōzō); Censor's seal: 極 kiwame;
